  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>12</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi></math>&nbsp;&nbsp;<br /><br />General points is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>)</mo></math><br /><br />It lies on the plane <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>.</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><br />Hence, the point of intersection will be<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>14</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br />Distance from <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></math> <math> <mrow> <mo>=</mo> <msqrt> <msup> <mrow> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mn>5</mn> <mo>-</mo> <mn>1</mn> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <mo>+</mo> <msup> <mrow> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mn>3</mn> <mo>-</mo> <mn>0</mn> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <mo>+</mo> <msup> <mrow> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mn>1</mn> <mn>4</mn> <mo>-</mo> <mn>2</mn> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> <mn>2</mn> </msup> </msqrt> </mrow> </math></p><p><math> <mrow> <mo>=</mo> <msqrt> <msup> <mn>4</mn> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <mo>+</mo> <msup> <mn>3</mn> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <mo>+</mo> <mn>1</mn> <msup> <mn>2</mn> <mn>2</mn> </msup> </msqrt> </mrow> </math></p><p><math> <mrow> <mo>=</mo> <mn>1</mn> <mn>3</mn> </mrow> </math></p>",
